{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22345","headline":"冀城北原作 · 白居易","name":"冀城北原作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野色何莽苍，秋声亦萧疎。\n风吹黄埃起，落日驱征车。\n何代此开国，封疆百里余。\n古今不相待，朝市无常居。\n昔人城邑中，今变爲丘墟。\n昔人墓田中，今化爲里闾。\n废兴相催迫，日月互居诸。\n世变无遗风，焉能知其初。\n行人千载後，怀古空踌躇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}